,"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005502","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1007","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,68,71,72,73,79],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005502","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,68,71,72,73,79],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005502","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,68,71,72,73,79],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005502","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10162","city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,68,71,72,73,79],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005502","armor":"WP1000405","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏时期著名边疆将领，刘虞旧部，曹魏北疆安边重臣。他早年为刘虞从事，在刘虞被公孙瓒杀害后，联合鲜于银、齐周等聚众报仇，与阎柔统领汉胡联军数万对抗公孙瓒；后在田豫劝说下归顺曹操，被封为建忠将军、督幽州六郡军事；曹魏建立后，历任虎牙将军、辅国将军，进封县侯，长期负责安抚乌桓、鲜卑等北方异族，稳定曹魏北疆秩序。曹丕即位，拜鲜于辅为虎牙将军，进封县侯，与度辽将军阎柔共同负责北方边疆事务，继续推行“怀柔安边”政策，安抚乌桓、鲜卑部落，使曹魏北疆保持稳定。黄初四年，曹丕派鲜于辅出使蜀汉，劝诸葛亮投降。","tc":"曹魏時期著名邊疆將領，劉虞舊部，曹魏北疆安邊重臣。他早年為劉虞從事，在劉虞被公孫瓚殺害后，聯合鮮于銀、齊周等聚眾報仇，與閻柔統領漢胡聯軍數萬對抗公孫瓚；后在田豫勸說下歸順曹操，被封為建忠將軍、督幽州六郡軍事；曹魏建立后，歷任虎牙將軍、輔國將軍，進封縣侯，長期負責安撫烏桓、鮮卑等北方異族，穩定曹魏北疆秩序。曹丕即位，拜鮮于輔為虎牙將軍，進封縣侯，與度遼將軍閻柔共同負責北方邊疆事務，繼續推行“懷柔安邊”政策，安撫烏桓、鮮卑部落，使曹魏北疆保持穩定。黃初四年，曹丕派鮮于輔出使蜀漢，勸諸葛亮投降。","en":"A celebrated frontier general of the Cao Wei era, a former subordinate of Liu Yu, and a key border-stabilizing minister of Cao Wei's northern frontier. In his early years, he served as an attendant under Liu Yu. After Liu Yu was murdered by Gongsun Zan, he joined Xianyu Yin, Qi Zhou, and others in mustering troops for vengeance, commanding a combined Hu-Han force of tens of thousands alongside Yan Rou to oppose Gongsun Zan. Later, at the urging of Tian Yu, he submitted to Cao Cao and was appointed General Who Builds Loyalty with supervisory authority over the military affairs of six commanderies in You Province. After the founding of Cao Wei, he held posts including General of the Tiger Teeth and General Who Supports the State, was elevated to County Marquis, and bore long-term responsibility for pacifying the Wuhuan, Xianbei, and other northern frontier peoples, maintaining order along Cao Wei's northern borders. Upon Cao Pi's accession, Xianyu Fu was appointed General of the Tiger Teeth and elevated to County Marquis. Together with Yan Rou, the General Who Crosses the Liao, he continued to manage northern frontier affairs and implement a policy of ‘conciliation and pacification’ that kept the Wuhuan and Xianbei tribes at peace, preserving stability along Cao Wei's northern borders. In the fourth year of Huangchu (223), Cao Pi dispatched Xianyu Fu on a diplomatic mission to Shu Han to persuade Zhuge Liang to surrender.","jp":"曹魏時代の著名な辺境の将であり、劉虞の旧部にして曹魏の北疆安定を担った重臣。若くして劉虞の従事を務め、劉虞が公孫瓚に殺害されると、鮮于銀や斉周らと共に兵を集めて仇討ちを謀り、閻柔と共に数万の漢胡連合軍を率いて公孫瓚に対抗した。のちに田豫の説得を受けて曹操に帰順し、建忠将軍に任じられて幽州六郡の軍事を督した。曹魏建国後は虎牙将軍、輔国将軍を歴任して県侯に進封され、長期にわたり烏桓や鮮卑など北方の異民族の慰撫にあたり、曹魏の北疆の秩序を安定させた。曹丕が即位すると虎牙将軍に拝されて県侯に進封し、度遼将軍の閻柔と共に北方辺境の軍務を司り、引き続き「懐柔安辺」の策を推し進めて烏桓や鮮卑の部族を慰撫し、曹魏の北辺の安定を維持した。黄初四年、曹丕の命により使者として蜀漢に赴き、諸葛亮に降伏を説いた。","kr":"조위 시기의 저명한 변방 장수이자 유우의 옛 부하로, 조위 북방 안정을 책임진 중신이다. 초년에 유우의 종사를 지냈으며, 유우가 공손찬에게 살해당하자 선우은, 제주 등과 함께 무리를 모아 원수를 갚고자 염유와 더불어 수만의 한·호 연합군을 통솔해 공손찬에 대항했다. 이후 전예의 설득으로 조조에게 귀순하여 건충장군에 봉해지고 유주 6군의 군사를 총괄했다. 조위 건국 후 호아장군과 보국장군을 역임하고 현후에 봉해졌으며, 오랫동안 오환과 선비 등 북방 이민족을 안무하여 조위 북방 국경의 질서를 안정시켰다. 조비가 즉위하자 선우보를 호아장군에 배수하고 현후로 진봉하였으며, 도료장군 염유와 함께 북방 변방 사무를 총괄하여 '회유안변(懷柔安邊)' 정책을 계속 추진해 오환과 선비 부족을 안무하고 조위 북방의 안정을 유지했다. 황초 4년, 조비는 선우보를 촉한에 사신으로 파견하여 제갈량에게 항복을 권유하게 했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1026315","remark":"","surname":"鲜于","surnameTc":"鮮于","surnameEn":"Xianyu","surnameJp":"鮮于","surnameKr":"선우","surnameOther":"","name":"辅","nameTc":"輔","nameEn":"Fu","nameJp":"輔","nameKr":"보","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"鲜于辅","power":"WJ10162","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1008","gender":"0","rule":"76","force":"68","wise":"71","politics":"72","charm":"73","will":"79","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"18/68/18/21/18/49/23/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6800","battleSoulPoint":"5800","debateSoulPoint":"5100","strategy":"1003808","strategy2":"1008401","professions":"0/2/4/2/0/0/2/2/1/1/2/2/2/1/0/1/3/1/2/1/1/0/3/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"26","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5800","evaluate":"3100","title":"","rank":"7","birth":"160","show":"184","death":"228","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1005502","armo